This is a placeholder for the 2026_Enterprise_AI_Atlas.pdf file. Please note that PDF files are binary files and cannot be directly created through text-based APIs. To properly upload a PDF file, you should:

1. Use the GitHub web interface to upload the file directly
2. Use a Git client locally and push the file
3. Or provide the file content in a format that can be transmitted via API

For binary files like PDFs, please use one of the methods above.